  "notes": [
    {
      "sentence": 1,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "a carpenter ant breaks from its colony's column in the lofty canopy.",
      "text": "（break from：脱离（群体、队伍）；\nin the lofty canopy：后置定语，修饰 column）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 2,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "it wanders downward, as if intoxicated, into leafy undergrowth.",
      "text": "（Swaying…：现在分词短语作伴随状语；\nas if intoxicated：as if 后省略了 it were）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 3,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "on a major vein underneath a leaf, about 25 centimetres above the ground.",
      "text": "（clench A on B：把A咬紧在B上；\nunderneath a leaf：后置定语，修饰 vein）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 4,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "yet the bite holds rigidly.",
      "text": "（by + 时间：到……时；yet：却，表转折）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 6,
      "chunk": 3,
      "source_English": "where foraging ants tread.",
      "text": "（push from：从……长出；where…：非限制性定语从句，修饰 the ground below）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 7,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "is fussy about location.",
      "text": "（Ophiocordyceps unilateralis：同位语，即 the invader；\nbe fussy about：对……挑剔）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 8,
      "chunk": 3,
      "source_English": "where the air is humid and the temperature suits the fungus.",
      "text": "（find A on B：发现A在B上；\nwhere…：非限制性定语从句，修饰 the north-west side of plants）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 10,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Placed on the ground, the bodies disappeared.",
      "text": "（Placed…：过去分词短语作状语，\n= When they were placed on the ground）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 12,
      "chunk": 3,
      "source_English": "a picture that evokes the strings of a puppet.",
      "text": "（a picture that…：同位语，概括前面描述的景象；\nthat 引导定语从句，修饰 picture）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 14,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "showed one such ant.",
      "text": "（with David Attenborough's narration：插入语，\n补充说明这一集）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 15,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "whose makers envisioned the parasite jumping to humans.",
      "text": "（help (to) do：帮助做……，to 可省；\nwhose…：定语从句，修饰 a 2013 video game；\nenvision sb/sth doing：设想……做某事）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 17,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "into the geological record.",
      "text": "（roots run deep：根源深远；far + 比较级：……得多）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 18,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "bears the same characteristic bite scars.",
      "text": "（bear：带有（痕迹、标记）；\n48-million-year-old：复合形容词，4800万年前的）"
    }
  ],
